      {
        "Id": "d12bd2e4b6164a0a8b96286e50a52e8f",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE:  pick each client document in its own import (PDF / Excel / Word; empty = skip) and press Run with RUN False = PREVIEW: every document is read and cross-checked, nothing in Revit changes.  Read the dialog + report, then RUN True.  BEP -> project info, BEP parameters, units, worksets, view templates.  SCHEDULE -> sheets + drawing register.  AIR / FM -> shared parameters + asset data schedules.  COBie -> COBie parameters + schedules.  MATERIALS -> approved materials created, codes / names fixed, register schedule.  CHECKLIST / WORKFLOW -> compliance checks.  Anything that cannot be done automatically is listed as MANUAL INPUT REQUIRED.  Report: Documents\\SD_Tools_A09\\<project code>.  Run again any time; Ctrl+Z undoes a run.",
        "DescriptionText": "",
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
